                        {
                            "id": "team_grid_html",
                            "elType": "widget",
                            "settings": {
                                "html": "<div class='founder-wrap'>\n  <div class='founder-row'>\n    <!-- Column 1: Founder Details -->\n    <div class='founder-sidebar'>\n      <div class='founder-img-box'>\n        <img src='https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1594744803329-e58b31de8bf5?q=80&w=1000&auto=format&fit=crop' alt='Komal S' />\n      </div>\n      <div class='founder-meta'>\n        <span class='meta-label'>Our Founder</span>\n        <h2 class='founder-name'>Komal S</h2>\n        <div class='founder-roles'>\n          <p>Host &middot; Sound Healing Facilitator &middot; Breathwork Facilitator</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class='founder-certs'>\n          <ul>\n            <li>Certified Sound Healing Facilitator</li>\n            <li>Certified Breathwork Facilitator</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n        <div class='founder-geo'>\n          <p>Greater Vancouver, BC</p>\n          <p class='experience'>Running sessions since Summer 2024</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Column 2 & 3: The Story -->\n    <div class='founder-story'>\n      <div class='story-col'>\n        <p>I started as a host. I ended up becoming a facilitator — not because I planned to, but because I couldn't stop learning.</p>\n        <p>I built Stillness because I needed it. I was drawn to sound healing and breathwork the way most people are — quietly, almost accidentally, through a door I wasn't sure I was ready to open.</p>\n        <p>In running sessions for others, I kept seeing the same thing.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class='story-col'>\n        <p>That's why I built Stillness. Not as a brand, but as a room. A real one. A space where people can put down what they've been carrying and remember what it feels like to be inside their own body without bracing for the next hard thing.</p>\n        <p>Since 2024, I've had the privilege of holding space for over 400 people across Vancouver, burnt-out professionals, exhausted parents, people in grief, people who came because a friend dragged them and almost turned around in the parking lot. Every single one of them changed something in me too.</p>\n        <p>I'm a certified sound healing and breathwork facilitator. But more than my certifications, I bring my own experience of the work. The genuine belief that healing is possible, that the nervous system can learn safety, and that one hour of real stillness can reach somewhere that years of pushing through cannot.</p>\n        <p>Stillness is honest work. It's not perfect. It's not finished. But it's real — and it keeps growing.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n.founder-wrap { width: 100%; max-width: 1280px; margin: 0 auto; }\n.founder-row {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 350px 1fr;\n    gap: 80px;\n    align-items: start;\n}\n.founder-sidebar { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 32px; }\n.founder-img-box {\n    width: 100%;\n    aspect-ratio: 4/5;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    background: #f0f0f0;\n}\n.founder-img-box img {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    object-fit: cover;\n    filter: grayscale(100%);\n    transition: all 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);\n    display: block;\n}\n.founder-wrap:hover .founder-img-box img {\n    filter: grayscale(0%);\n}\n\n.meta-label {\n    font-family: 'Lato', sans-serif !important;\n    font-size: 12px !important;\n    font-weight: 700 !important;\n    text-transform: uppercase !important;\n    letter-spacing: 0.2em !important;\n    color: #688F9D !important;\n    display: block;\n    margin-bottom: 8px !important;\n}\n.founder-name {\n    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif !important;\n    font-size: 40px !important;\n    line-height: 1.1 !important;\n    color: #1D3152 !important;\n    margin: 0 0 16px !important;\n}\n.founder-roles p {\n    font-family: 'Lato', sans-serif !important;\n    font-size: 14px !important;\n    color: #1D3152 !important;\n    margin: 0 0 24px !important;\n    line-height: 1.6 !important;\n}\n.founder-certs ul {\n    list-style: none !important;\n    padding: 0 !important;\n    margin: 0 0 24px !important;\n    border-top: 1px solid rgba(29, 49, 82, 0.1);\n    padding-top: 16px !important;\n}\n.founder-certs li {\n    font-family: 'Lato', sans-serif !important;\n    font-size: 13px !important;\n    color: #1D3152 !important;\n    margin-bottom: 8px !important;\n    opacity: 0.8;\n}\n.founder-geo p {\n    font-family: 'Lato', sans-serif !important;\n    font-size: 13px !important;\n    color: #688F9D !important;\n    margin: 0 !important;\n}\n.founder-geo .experience {\n    font-style: italic !important;\n    margin-top: 4px !important;\n}\n\n.founder-story {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n    gap: 48px;\n}\n.story-col p {\n    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif !important;\n    font-size: 19px !important;\n    line-height: 1.7 !important;\n    color: #1D3152 !important;\n    margin-bottom: 24px !important;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 1024px) {\n    .founder-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 64px; }\n    .founder-sidebar { max-width: 400px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; }\n    .founder-certs ul { border-top: none; }\n    .founder-story { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 0; }\n}\n</style>"
                            },
